WEBVTT

00:29:26.636 --> 00:29:30.556
WPR: Well, Christiane, thank you so much
for taking the time to chat with us today,

00:29:30.596 --> 00:29:31.996
I think I speak for everyone,

00:29:32.036 --> 00:29:34.556
just appreciating
everything that you’ve shared.

00:29:34.596 --> 00:29:37.036
and good luck with the rest of your day.

00:29:37.076 --> 00:29:39.036
CA: Thank you very much, I appreciate it.

00:29:39.076 --> 00:29:41.636
It was good to talk to you all,
thanks Whitney.

00:29:41.676 --> 00:29:44.116
[Want to support TED?]

00:29:44.156 --> 00:29:45.796
[Become a TED Member!]

00:29:45.836 --> 00:29:47.476
